{
  "Our Free Model — 在 dsh 里装上这个插件即可，无需登录、注册或填 API Key，就能使用包括 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash、Kimi K3 在内的前沿模型，桌面端另有 EAC 协付渠道；2.0 起接入 CodeArts、CodeBuddy、WorkBuddy、LobsterAI、Qoder、TRAE、Cline、Loomy、Raccoon、MiniMax、ZCode、Gemini 十三个账号渠道（原有匿名免费通道保留）（登录、账号池、积分领取、本地 OpenAI 网关与局域网转发、数据看板与运行日志），六页毛玻璃界面统一呈现。": "Our Free Model — install this plugin in dsh and use frontier models including DeepSeek V4.1 Flash and Kimi K3 with no login, registration, or API key. The desktop app adds the EAC co-payment channel; from 2.0 it connects thirteen account channels (CodeArts, CodeBuddy, WorkBuddy, LobsterAI, Qoder, TRAE, Cline, Loomy, Raccoon, MiniMax, ZCode, and Gemini) while keeping the original anonymous free channel (login, account pool, credit claiming, a local OpenAI gateway and LAN forwarding, a dashboard, and a runtime log), all presented across six frosted-glass pages.",
  "DSH Web 界面右下角的 DeepSeek 余额小鲸鱼挂件:余额/今日已用/峰谷定价、自定义泡泡点击序列(文本/余额/今日/峰谷/图片/随机语句与并列加权选择)、逐行样式与字体、悬浮快捷编辑、音效与每轮消耗、自定义角色/动图/音效、吸附与翻转自定义": "A DeepSeek balance whale widget in the bottom-right of the DSH Web interface: balance, today's usage, and peak/off-peak pricing; a customisable bubble click sequence (text, balance, today, peak/off-peak, image, random lines with weighted parallel choice); per-row styling and fonts; hover quick-edit; sound effects and per-turn usage; custom characters, animations, and audio; snapping and flip customisation.",
  "聊天区的动效：跟随、自动开合与卷帘门、新文字淡入、文件变更行、发送时的气泡动效、过程组标题上的计数，以及说明模型正在做什么的那一行。开启时播放本插件的这一套，关闭后聊天区交回宿主——宿主自己的说法也一并回来。「动画」设为「减弱」时一律停在原处。": "The conversation area's motion: the follow, the automatic folding with its rolling door, the text fade, the file change rows, the send flight, the counted figures on each process group's header and the line saying what the model is doing. On plays this plugin's set; off hands the conversation back to the host, its own words included. With Animation set to Reduced it all stands still.",
  "web_fetch 由谁抓取：providers 用填了 Key 的引擎（都没有或都失败时退回 dsh 自带的本地抓取）；dsh 直接用 dsh 自带的本地抓取（免费，不经第三方，但不渲染 JS）。": "Who performs web_fetch: providers uses the engines with a key configured (falling back to dsh's own local fetching when none is set or all fail); dsh uses dsh's own local fetching directly (free, no third party, but it does not render JavaScript).",
  "Our Free Model — 在 dsh 里装上这个插件即可，无需登录、注册或填 API Key，就能使用包括 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash、Kimi K3 在内的前沿模型，桌": "Our Free Model — install this plugin in dsh and use frontier models including DeepSeek V4.1 Flash and Kimi K3 with no login, registration, or API key, on the desktop",
  "为 DeepSeek Harness 网页界面复刻 Claude Code Desktop 的主题插件——象牙白与暖黑双画布、陶烬橙强调色、Claude 风格模型选择器、权限分段与账户抽屉。": "A theme plugin that recreates Claude Code Desktop for the DeepSeek Harness web interface: ivory and warm-black canvases, ember-orange accents, a Claude-style model picker, permission segments, and an account drawer.",
  "在 DeepSeek Harness 内直连免密免费模型：清单跟随上游更新、地区可用性自动探测、思考强度档位真实生效，并附 Token 用量看板与 OpenAI 兼容的本地转发端口。": "Connect directly to key-free free models inside DeepSeek Harness: the catalog follows upstream updates, regional availability is probed automatically, reasoning effort takes real effect, and it includes a token usage dashboard plus an OpenAI-compatible local forwarding port.",
  "是否允许模型调用 web_fetch（URL 内容抓取）。web_fetch 工具由 dsh 统一挂载，关闭后调用会返回明确的错误提示，而不是从工具表移除；切换即时生效，无需重启。": "Whether the model may call web_fetch (URL content fetching). The web_fetch tool is mounted by dsh itself; turning it off returns a clear error instead of removing it from the tool list. The change takes effect immediately, with no restart.",
  "搜索策略：fallback 逐个尝试（最省额度）；race 同时调用前 N 个引擎、取最快的；merge 同时调用前 N 个引擎并合并去重（召回最好，消耗 N 倍额度）。": "Search strategy: fallback tries each engine in turn (cheapest on quota); race calls the first N engines at once and takes the fastest; merge calls the first N engines at once and combines and deduplicates the results (best recall, at N times the quota).",
  "此页面经远程地址连接 DSH，DSH 只保存从 localhost 等本机地址打开的页面所做的改动。这里显示的是 DSH 当前的设置，请在运行 DSH 的电脑上修改。": "This page reaches DSH through a remote address, and DSH saves settings only from a page opened at a local address such as localhost. The values shown are the ones DSH holds; change them on the computer running DSH.",
  "DSH 正在运行时无法更新，而更新前的版本也已经损坏。为避免下次启动卡住，市场把它从 profile 里移除。插件目录还在原处，退出 DSH 后重新安装即可。": "DSH cannot be updated while it is running, and the pre-update version is corrupted. To avoid getting stuck on the next launch, the market removes it from the profile. The plugin directory is still in place, just exit DSH and reinstall.",
  "取消时，旧版本已被清掉一部分。为避免下次启动卡住，市场把它从 profile 里移除。插件目录还在原处，重新安装即可；若再次失败，先退出 DSH 再装。": "When cancelled, the old version was partially cleared. To avoid getting stuck on the next launch, the market removes it from the profile. The plugin directory is still in place, just reinstall it; if it fails again, exit DSH and install it again.",
  "定义 Provider 的调用顺序。排在前面的服务会优先执行，如果请求失败（或额度用尽），会自动按照该顺序 fallback 到下一个可用服务。": "Define the order in which providers are called. Services earlier in the list run first; if a request fails or the quota runs out, it falls back to the next available service in that order.",
  "GitHub token（仅本次会话内存，刷新后需重新输入；留空则使用服务端 DSH_GITHUB_TOKEN 或已登录的 gh CLI）": "GitHub token (only the memory of this session needs to be re-entered after refreshing; leave blank to use the server DSH_GITHUB_token or the logged-in gh CLI)",
  "将删除：市场的停用清单与自定义分组，以及它写进配置文件的停用记录——被停用的插件将恢复运行。不涉及密码或密钥，市场从不把它们存在磁盘上。": "Will delete: the deactivation list of the market with the custom grouping, and the deactivation record it writes to the profile - the deactivated plugin will resume operation. There are no passwords or keys involved, and the market never stores them on disk.",
  "评论来自 GitHub Discussions。打开后会连接 giscus.app 与 GitHub；发表评论需要 GitHub 账号。": "Comment from GitHub Discussions. Opening it will connect giscus.app to GitHub; a GitHub account is required to leave a comment.",
  "右侧栏停靠的面板画成悬浮卡片：四周留 8px、16px 圆角、1px 描边与投影；关闭后铺满整列、贴住四边，分栏时每栏铺满各自那一栏。": "Draw the right sidebar's docked panels as floating cards: 8px inside the column, a 16px radius, a hairline and an elevation. Off fills the column and hugs its edges; a split gives each pane its own column.",
  "所有带 Key 的抓取都失败时，用不带 Key 的 Jina Reader 兜底（有速率限制）。没配抓取引擎时它就是唯一的抓取通道。": "When every keyed fetch fails, fall back to the keyless Jina Reader (rate limited). With no fetch engine configured it is the only fetch channel.",
  "有 Agent 正在运行，请等它完成或先取消，再更新——更新会直接替换插件文件，运行中的 Agent 可能中途报错或新旧版本混用。": "There is an agent running, please wait for it to complete or cancel before updating - the update will directly replace the plugin file. The running agent may report errors or mix old and new versions.",
  "调整左侧栏的紧凑程度。「宽松」是现在的样子；「紧凑」缩短上侧各行到工作区之间的间隙、压低对话行的高度与行间距、收紧账号区的内边距。": "Adjust how tight the sidebar is. Relaxed is how it looks now; Compact shortens the gap between the sidebar's top rows and the workspace, takes the conversation rows' height and spacing down, and trims the account area's padding.",
  "当前会话已被占用，可能是其他正在运行的 DSH 导致的（如其他 dsh web、桌面端），请退出其他正在运行的 DSH 后重试。": "This session is already in use, possibly by another running DSH instance (such as another dsh web or the desktop app). Quit the other DSH instances and try again.",
  "面向智能体与代码任务，198B/11B 稀疏 MoE，图像与视频理解，256K 上下文，最高 400 tokens/s。": "For agentic and coding tasks: 198B/11B sparse MoE with image and video understanding, 256K context, up to 400 tokens/s.",
  "已安装，但不是最新版：这个 profile 的 minimumReleaseAge 挡住了 {0}，安装的是 {1}。": "Installed, but not the latest version: This profile's minimumReleaseAge blocks {0}, installing {1}.",
  "npm 近30天滚动下载量：{0}。这不是累计下载量，也不代表独立用户数。统计可能延迟，来源核验时间不保证数据完整。": "npm rolling downloads in the last 30 days: {0}. This is not a cumulative download and does not represent the number of unique users. Statistics may be delayed, and the source verification time does not guarantee the completeness of the data.",
  "当前 dsh 进程正被调试器连接。请从 IDE 或终端停止该进程后重新启动，市场不能从界面里结束正在调试的 dsh。": "The current dsh process is being connected by the debugger. Please restart the process after stopping it from the IDE or terminal, the market cannot end the dsh being debugged from the interface.",
  "在这里登录会离开本页，返回时需重新打开 dsh web——这不是故障。发表评论请到 GitHub，本页只用于阅读。": "Logging in here will leave this page, and you will need to reopen the dsh web when you return - this is not a glitch. Leave a comment on GitHub, this page is for reading only.",
  "同一模型，thinking 开启：先推理再作答（推理流作为思考块回传）。适合数学/多步调试/规划，更慢也更耗额度": "Same model with thinking on: reasons before answering, with the reasoning stream returned as a thinking block. Suits math, multi-step debugging, and planning; slower and heavier on quota.",
  "替换标志旁的品牌名称，宽度按图片比例随高度换算，优先于品牌名称。PNG、SVG 或 WebP，不超过 2 MB。": "Replaces the brand name beside the mark; its width follows the image's proportions at the row's height, and it takes precedence over the brand name. PNG, SVG or WebP, up to 2 MB.",
  "有 Agent 正在运行，请等它完成或先取消，再安装——安装会改动插件文件，运行中的 Agent 可能中途报错。": "There is an Agent running, please wait for it to complete or cancel before installing--Installation will change the plugin file, and the running Agent may report errors halfway.",
  "Apache 2.0 开放权重多模态模型，细粒度 MoE，675B 总参 / 41B 激活，256K 上下文。": "Apache-2.0 open-weight multimodal MoE with 675B total / 41B active parameters and 256K context.",
  "替换侧栏顶部、折叠栏、新会话页与账号行兜底头像上的品牌标志。PNG、SVG 或 WebP，不超过 2 MB。": "Replaces the brand mark at the top of the sidebar, on the collapsed rail, on the new-conversation page and as the account row's fallback picture. PNG, SVG or WebP, up to 2 MB.",
  "生成速度 1,664 tokens/s，超过 Mercury 2 的 5 倍，MMLU-Pro 75.9%。": "Generates 1,664 tokens/s, over 5x Mercury 2, at 75.9% MMLU-Pro.",
  "由于活动异常，我们已于 <strong>{time}</strong> 暂停你的账户。你的对话与数据都还在。": "We put your account on hold on <strong>{time}</strong> because of unusual activity. Your chats and data are safe.",
  "这些目录不被任何插件使用，也不影响启动，是更新中断后留下的。退出 DSH 后可以删除，或重新安装对应的插件。": "These directories are not used by any plugins and do not affect startup, they are left after the update is interrupted. After exiting DSH, you can remove or reinstall the corresponding plugin.",
  "另一个安装、更新或卸载还在进行，现在还不能开始：这一条留在队列里，等它完成后会自动开始，不需要再点一次。": "Another installation, update or uninstallation is still in progress and cannot be started yet: this one stays in the queue and will start automatically once it is completed, no need to click again.",
  "本次重启没有成功，dsh 已经退出。勾选你希望下次启动时启用的插件；本次启动报错的插件已标红并取消勾选。": "This reboot was unsuccessful and dsh has exited. Check the plugin that you want to enable the next time you start; the plugin that reported an error on this startup has been red and unchecked.",
  "这一条要装的插件在当前目录里找不到了（目录刷新过或换了页），已从队列移除。请在目录里重新找到它再装一次。": "This plugin to be installed cannot be found in the current directory (the directory has been refreshed or changed pages), it has been removed from the queue. Please find it again in the catalog and install it again.",
  "「原色」保留图片自己的颜色；「文字色」把图片当作形状，按所在位置的文字颜色上色，亮色暗色下都看得清。": "Original keeps the images' own colours; Text colour uses each image as a shape filled with the text colour where it stands, so it reads in both light and dark.",
  "cordis 不接受重复的条目 id，保留它会让 DeepSeek Harness 下次启动失败。": "cordis does not accept duplicate entry ids, keeping it will cause DeepSeek Harness to fail the next time it starts.",
  "插件把 DSH 自带的公共包列进了依赖，可能和 DSH 自己的版本互相干扰（仅依据声明，未确认）：": "The plugin lists the public packages that come with DSH as dependencies, which may interfere with DSH's own version (by declaration only, unconfirmed):",
  "相同的搜索或抓取在这么多分钟内直接返回缓存，不再消耗额度。0 为关闭。缓存只在内存里，重启即清空。": "Return cached results for identical searches or fetches within this many minutes, without spending quota. 0 disables it. The cache lives in memory only and clears on restart.",
  "等待 DeepSeek Harness 启动超时。可点「调整插件」，检查是否某个插件导致无法启动。": "Timeout waiting for DeepSeek Harness to start. Click \"Adjust Plugin\" to check if a plugin cannot be started.",
  "请帮我修复 DeepSeek Harness 的插件问题（profile：{0}）。诊断发现如下：": "Please help me fix a plugin issue for DeepSeek Harness (profile: {0}). The diagnostic findings are as follows:",
  "按钮、选中标记、链接与焦点环使用的颜色；未指定时沿用所选品牌的主色。配色选「跟随宿主」时不生效。": "The colour of buttons, selected marks, links and focus rings. Unset, the chosen brand's own accent stays. It has no effect while Colours is set to Follow the host.",
  "给模型菜单的每一行标出此刻的峰价、谷价或限时活动，以及距离切换还有多久。关闭后各行只显示模型名。": "Marks every row of the model menu with the peak, off-peak or promotional rate in force right now, and how long it lasts. Off leaves the rows bare.",
  "同一模型，thinking 关闭：直接作答、最快、最省免费额度。适合工具调用/改写/检索类任务": "Same model with thinking off: answers directly, fastest, and cheapest on free quota. Suits tool calls, rewriting, and retrieval tasks.",
  "已下载完成。重启 DeepSeek Harness 后新版本才会生效——页面会先显示新版本号。": "Download complete. Restart DeepSeek Harness to activate the update.",
  "精选目录里有同名插件，但与你本地仓库不一致，无法安全恢复。可以卸载本地版，或继续用本地开发。": "There is a plugin with the same name in the featured directory, but it does not match your local repository and cannot be safely recovered. You can uninstall the local version or continue with local development.",
  "面向代码生成，H100 上超 1,000 tokens/s，速度最高为同类模型的 10 倍。": "Built for code, over 1,000 tokens/s on H100, up to 10x faster than speed-optimized LLMs.",
  "结合实时网络信息与引用的搜索 API，从轻量 Sonar 到多步深研 Sonar Pro。": "Search APIs answering with fresh web data and citations, from light Sonar to deep-research Sonar Pro.",
  "该插件需要运行构建脚本才能工作，出于安全考虑已默认阻止。确认来源可信后，可放行并重新安装：": "The plugin requires a build script to run in order to work and has been blocked by default for security reasons. Once the source is verified, it can be released and reinstalled:",
  "把当前的插件顺序和已停用的插件保存为组合，随时切换；应用前会先试启动一次并自动创建快照。": "Save the current plugin order and deactivated plugins as a combination and switch at any time; try to launch it once and automatically create a snapshot before applying.",
  "Tavily 搜索深度：advanced 结果更相关，但每次消耗 2 credits。": "Tavily search depth: advanced returns more relevant results but costs 2 credits per call.",
  "WebDAV 地址与用户名仅保存在当前浏览器；密码只存于服务端，每次会话需重新输入。": "The WebDAV address and username are only saved in the current browser; the password is only stored on the server side and needs to be re-entered each session.",
  "还没有收藏。在「发现」或「主题」里点书签图标，或在「已安装」的「···」里加入收藏。": "No favorites yet. Tap the bookmark icon in Discover or Themes, or add a collection to Installed.",
  "保留市场数据。注意：被市场停用的插件会保持停用，且移除后将没有界面可将其重新启用。": "Keep market data. Note: Plugins that are deactivated by the market will remain deactivated and there will be no interface to re-enable them once removed.",
  "将诊断问题交由新对话中的 Agent 修复（内容已复制到剪贴板，由你决定是否发送）": "Refer the diagnostic issue to the Agent in the new conversation for repair (the content has been copied to the clipboard and you decide whether to send it or not)",
  "目录记录的 npm 版本；目录每日刷新，可能滞后于 npm 上的实际 latest": "The npm version of the directory record; the directory is refreshed daily and may lag behind the actual latest on npm",
  "全选 = 完整备份（含配置文件）；否则只导出勾选的插件，可另勾「包含配置文件」。": "Select All = Full backup (including configuration files); otherwise, only checked plug-ins can be exported, and \"Include configuration files\" can be checked separately.",
  "桌面端把会话标题与顶栏那一行的控件抬进窗口的标题栏，放不下的一侧留在原来的行里。": "On the desktop the session title and the header's controls rise into the window's caption row, and a side without room stays in the header's own row.",
  "Micro/Lite/Pro/Premier 四档，支持文本、图像与视频输入。": "Micro, Lite, Pro and Premier tiers taking text, image and video.",
  "安装来源是另一台电脑上的本地路径，本机找不到。请重新安装该插件，或改为本机路径": "The installation source is a local path on another computer, which the machine cannot find. Please reinstall the plugin or change to the native path",
  "已卸载，但 pnpm 在收尾阶段报错（通常是文件被占用）；配置已同步，无需重试": "Uninstalled, but pnpm reported an error at the closing stage (usually the file is occupied); the configuration is synchronized, no need to retry",
  "精选目录里没有这个插件，无法恢复到线上版本。可以卸载本地版，或继续用本地开发。": "This plugin is not available in the featured directory and cannot be restored to the online version. You can uninstall the local version or continue with local development.",
  "仅包含插件清单和 profile 配置，不含插件文件；恢复时按清单重新安装。": "Only the plugin manifest and profile configuration are included, no plugin files are included; reinstall according to the manifest when restoring.",
  "分 Pro 与 Turbo 两档的新一代生产力智能体，以通用任务与代码见长。": "Pro and Turbo tiers of a next-generation productivity agent, strong at general agentic and coding tasks.",
  "日志已导出：dsh-market-log.txt，请将其附在 issue 中": "Log exported: dsh-market-log.txt, please attach it to issue",
  "目录（{0} 刷新）记录的 npm 版本；之后发布的版本要等下次刷新才会出现": "The npm version of the directory ({0} refresh) record; subsequent releases will not appear until the next refresh",
  "社区 bundle 加载顺序与插件声明的 before/after 规则冲突": "The community bundle loading order conflicts with the before/after rules declared by the plugin",
  "经 50+ 内部业务场景验证，每日千亿级 token 用量打磨，支持多模态。": "Validated across 50+ internal scenarios and hundreds of billions of daily tokens, with multimodal support.",
  "面向工具调用、RAG 与多语言，Command A 为 111B/256K。": "For tool use, RAG and multilingual work; Command A is 111B with 256K context.",
  "面向编程与办公，2.4 万亿参数 MoE，1M 上下文、思考模式与内置工具。": "A 2.4T-parameter MoE for coding and office work, with 1M context, thinking mode and built-in tools.",
  "「随系统」跟随系统的动画设置；「减弱」把动画停在代表帧；「总是」始终播放。": "Follow the system keeps the system's animation setting in charge; Reduced holds animations on their still frame; Always plays them. The background-work ring turns in every setting.",
  "GitHub 认证失败：Token 无效、已过期，或 gh CLI 未登录": "GitHub authentication failed: Token is invalid, expired, or gh CLI is not logged in",
  "该顺序会改变组合：{0} 处覆盖、{1} 个无效条目、{2} 个重复条目": "This order changes the combination: {0} overrides, {1} invalid entries, {2} duplicate entries",
  "面向复杂专业工作、金融与科研，1.1 mini 为 35B、可本地部署。": "For complex professional work, finance and science; the 35B 1.1 mini runs locally.",
  "Agent 正忙，已排队，空闲后自动卸载（可在右上角「任务」里取消）。": "Agent is busy, queued, and uninstalled automatically when idle (can be canceled in Tasks in the top right corner).",
  "Agent 正忙，已排队，空闲后自动安装（可在右上角「任务」里取消）。": "The agent is busy, queued, and automatically installed when it is free (can be canceled in the \"Tasks\" in the top right corner).",
  "Agent 正忙，已排队，空闲后自动更新（可在右上角「任务」里取消）。": "The agent is busy, queued, and will automatically update when it is free (can be canceled in the \"Tasks\" in the top right corner).",
  "MIT 许可，314B 总参 / 13.2B 激活，256K 上下文。": "MIT-licensed, 314B total / 13.2B active, 256K context.",
  "从云端到边缘的前沿模型，开放权重与商用并行，可 API 调用或自托管。": "Frontier models from cloud to edge, open-weight and commercial, via API or self-hosting.",
  "回滚会用快照覆盖当前的插件与配置，且不可撤销（可先创建新快照再回滚）。": "Rollbacks overwrite the current plugin and configuration with a snapshot and are irreversible (you can create a new snapshot before rolling back).",
  "正在重启：dsh 启动后本页会刷新；若又失败，会带着新的报错回到这里。": "Restarting: This page will refresh after dsh starts; if it fails again, it will return here with a new error report.",
  "由环境变量 DSHM_GITHUB_PROXY 管理，界面中不可修改。": "Managed by DSHM_GITHUB_PROXY environment variable.",
  "保存自动化任务，到点后在原会话中执行，并为智能体提供管理任务的工具。": "Save automated tasks, run them in the original session when due, and give agents a tool to manage them.",
  "每条结果的摘要长度（字符）。越长上下文越多，也越费模型 token。": "Summary length per result, in characters. Longer means more context and more model tokens.",
  "结果地区（ISO 3166 两位代码）。auto 使用各引擎默认值。": "Result region (a two-letter ISO 3166 code). auto uses each engine's default.",
  "下面标红的插件在本次启动时报了错，取消勾选后下次启动不再启用它们。": "The plugins marked red below reported an error on this startup, and they will not be enabled on the next startup after unchecking them.",
  "重启方式：关闭当前 dsh 进程后重新运行（例如 dsh web）": "Restart method: Run again after closing the current dsh process (e.g. dsh web)",
  "面向边缘与本地部署，Phi-4 以 14B 专注推理、数学与代码。": "For edge and local use; Phi-4 (14B) targets reasoning, math and code.",
  "Gemini 图像生成与编辑模型，支持自然语言对话式创建与修改。": "Gemini's image generation and editing model, with conversational creation and refinement.",
  "在本机使用 SenseVoice 转写录音，首次使用需安装依赖。": "Transcribe recordings locally with SenseVoice; install its dependencies on first use.",
  "将卸载本地版本并安装线上版本，之后照常检查更新。此操作无法撤销。": "The local version will be uninstalled and the online version will be installed, after which the update will be checked as usual. This action cannot be undone.",
  "已按 DSH {0} 筛选；未声明或无法确认兼容性的插件仍会显示": "Filtered by DSH {0}; undeclared or incompatible plugins will still show",
  "恢复将覆盖当前 profile 配置并重新安装插件，确定继续吗？": "Restoring will overwrite the current profile configuration and reinstall the plugin, are you sure you want to continue?",
  "正在检查宿主要求 {0}/{1}；未声明或无法确认的插件仍会显示": "Checking host requirements {0}/{1}; undeclared or unconfirmed plugins will still be displayed",
  "该 npm 包可能由其他人发布，并非同一插件；确认可信后再继续。": "The npm package may be published by someone else and is not the same plugin; confirm it is trusted before proceeding.",
  "一组只有一个主题。选择不会启用它，更换会把原来的主题移出该组。": "A group has only one subject. Choosing not to enable it and replacing it will move the original topic out of the group.",
  "主打智能体推理、工具调用、编程与多模态输入，面向长上下文任务。": "Agentic reasoning, tool use, coding and multimodal input for long-context work.",
  "我们会把你的对话、项目和设置打包供你下载。这可能需要一些时间。": "We’ll package up your conversations, projects, and settings for download. This might take some time to complete.",
  "首个集前沿编程、1M 上下文与原生多模态于一身的开放权重模型。": "The first open-weight model combining frontier coding, 1M context and native multimodality.",
  "为 Codex 智能体编程优化，可并行处理多项软件工程任务。": "Optimized for agentic coding in Codex, handling several software tasks in parallel.",
  "应用变更前会自动创建快照；也可手动创建，随时回滚到任意状态。": "Snapshots are automatically created before changes are applied, or they can be created manually and rolled back to any state at any time.",
  "排队时它还在已安装列表里，现在已不在，因此跳过（没有卸载）。": "It was still in the installed list at the time of queuing and is no longer there, so it was skipped (not uninstalled).",
  "从这个 profile 卸载市场。已装的其它插件不受影响。": "Uninstall the market from this profile. Other installed plugins are not affected.",
  "开放权重与云端 API 并行，覆盖文本、图像、音频与视频。": "Open weights and cloud APIs across text, image, audio and video.",
  "提供自动审查权限模式，由模型在每次工具调用前判断是否授权。": "Provide an automatic approval permission mode where the model decides whether to authorize each tool call.",
  "替换侧栏顶部的品牌文字；留空时显示所选品牌自己的文字标志。": "Replaces the brand text at the top of the sidebar. Leave empty to keep the chosen brand's own wordmark.",
  "本页检查插件冲突、依赖版本不匹配与加载顺序问题。常用术语：": "This page checks for plugin conflicts, dependency version mismatches, and loading order issues. Common terms:",
  "检测到兼容性风险，建议重启前到诊断页处理，或回滚本次操作。": "Compatibility risk detected, it is recommended to go to the diagnostics page before restarting, or roll back this operation.",
  "每一步把当前时间、浏览器时区和距上一条消息的时长告诉模型。": "Tell the model the current time, the browser time zone, and the time since the last message on every step.",
  "账户保留彩蛋页（点账户弹层顶部的用户名行进入）使用的语言。": "The language of the account-hold easter egg page (open it from the account row at the top of the sidebar footer popover). It does not follow the interface language.",
  "静态扫描只能证明「有」，不能证明「没有」。这不代表它安全。": "A static scan can only prove yes, not no. This does not mean it is safe.",
  "Codex 风格侧栏、工作区会话树、全局搜索和轮次导航。": "A Codex-style sidebar, workspace session tree, global search, and turn navigation.",
  "SKILL.md 需包含 YAML 格式的技能名称和描述": "SKILL.md must include YAML name and description",
  "下列插件的界面文件已损坏，刷新后页面可能空白，建议回滚：": "The interface files of the following plugins are corrupted. After refreshing, the page may be blank. It is recommended to roll back:",
  "优先的域名，每行一个：结果中来自这些域名的条目排到前面。": "Preferred domains, one per line: results from these domains are ranked first.",
  "作答前深入思考，从 o1 到 o3 与 o4-mini。": "Trained to think more deeply before responding, from o1 through o3 and o4-mini.",
  "全球最智能的模型之一，支持原生工具使用以及实时搜索功能。": "One of the most intelligent models in the world, with native tool use and real-time search.",
  "加载顺序 = 插件被激活的先后，后加载者可能覆盖先加载者": "Loading order = the order in which the plugin is activated, the last loader may override the first loader",
